# The Last Ride {B}, 13/13: "The Last Ride gets -X/-X, where X is your life total." A negative life total makes X 0, not a
# negative number, so the Vehicle never grows past its printed 13/13 (CR 107.1b; the same ruling as Death's Shadow's). Bot1
# starts at 1 life and on turn 1 casts Platinum Angel (Black Lotus, Sol Ring, Mox Jet and Mox Emerald) so it can't lose the game;
# Bot2's Lightning Bolt on turn 2 takes Bot1 to -2. On turn 3 Bot1 casts The Last Ride from its Swamp and crews it with the
# Angel: it is a 13/13 artifact creature, not a 15/15.

[Life]
Bot1: 1

